  "avQWhatIsBav": "What is BAV?",
  "avQHowToRead": "How to read these scores",
  "avQSavVsBav": "SAV vs BAV",
  "avABody": "Ashtakavarga is a points-based strength system in Vedic astrology. Each planet awards benefic points (bindus, also called rekhas) to the twelve signs based on its position. More points in a sign means that area of life gets smoother support during related planetary periods and transits.",
  "avSavBody": "SAV (Sarva Ashtakavarga) adds together the points from all seven planets for each sign. It gives a single strength score per sign, so you can quickly see which signs — and the houses they fall in — are best supported in your chart.",
  "avBavBody": "BAV (Bhinna Ashtakavarga) shows the points from a single planet across the twelve signs. It tells you which signs a specific planet supports most, which matters when that planet's dasha or transit is active.",
  "avHowToReadBody": "Higher numbers are better. For SAV, an average sign scores about 28 points — above 30 is strong and below 25 needs care. For BAV, each sign ranges from 0 to 8, with 4 being average. Favour your strongest signs for important actions, and stay patient and disciplined with your weakest ones.",
  "avSavVsBavBody": "SAV is the combined total of all planets and shows a sign's overall strength. BAV is a single planet's contribution and shows which planet supports that sign. Use SAV for the big picture, and BAV to understand which planet drives a sign's strength.",
  "avSummaryInsight": "Your chart is strongest in {s1}, {s2} and {s3}. These signs give better support during planetary periods and transits. {weak} currently has the least support, so patience and discipline help in matters connected with it.",
  "@avSummaryInsight": {"placeholders": {"s1": {"type": "Object"}, "s2": {"type": "Object"}, "s3": {"type": "Object"}, "weak": {"type": "Object"}}},
  "avBavInsight": "{planet} performs strongest through {s1} and {s2}. Matters governed by {planet} tend to improve when these signs are activated.",
  "@avBavInsight": {"placeholders": {"planet": {"type": "Object"}, "s1": {"type": "Object"}, "s2": {"type": "Object"}}},
  "avInsightStrong": "Your strongest signs are {s1} and {s2} — favour important beginnings when planets transit them.",
  "@avInsightStrong": {"placeholders": {"s1": {"type": "Object"}, "s2": {"type": "Object"}}},
  "avInsightWeak": "{s1} has the least support — move carefully and avoid over-commitment in its matters.",
  "@avInsightWeak": {"placeholders": {"s1": {"type": "Object"}}},
  "avInsightBestPlanet": "{planet} carries the most points, so its significations are well supported in your life.",
  "@avInsightBestPlanet": {"placeholders": {"planet": {"type": "Object"}}},
  "avInsightWeakPlanet": "{planet} carries the fewest points and benefits most from remedies and conscious effort.",
  "@avInsightWeakPlanet": {"placeholders": {"planet": {"type": "Object"}}},
